    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d557-a2">

                <pb facs="0972" n="876" xml:id="pg876"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Decree.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-02-26"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 26,
                        1874</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Exercising the powers and functions conceded to me by the constitution, I hereby
                    order that Don Juan Zavala y de la Puente, minister of war, be charged with the
                    presidency of the council of ministers.</p>
                <p>The President of the executive power of the republic,</p>
                <closer><signed>FRANCISCO SERRANO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The minister of state,<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Praxedes Mateo
                            Sagasta.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
